@BullMarket.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164
@customerId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health Checks
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Liveness Probe
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### Readiness Probe
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI Document
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Scalar API Reference (open in browser)
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/scalar/v1

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Catalog & Products
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Categories
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Get Products (Paged)
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Search Products
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/search?keyword=laptop&category=ai-laptops&aiReady=true&minPrice=100000&maxPrice=300000&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Get Product by ID
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Inventory
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Product Inventory
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

### Check Inventory Availability
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/{{productId}}/availability?quantity=2
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Customers
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Customer Profile
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Customer Orders
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Shopping Cart
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Customer Cart
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{customerId}}
Accept: application/json

### Add Item to Cart
POST {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{customerId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Update Item Quantity in Cart
PUT {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{customerId}}/items/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### Remove Item from Cart
DELETE {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{customerId}}/items/{{productId}}

### Clear Entire Cart
DELETE {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/{{customerId}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Orders
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create Order from Cart
POST {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "shippingAddress": {
    "recipientName": "Aarav Sharma",
    "line1": "101 Developer Avenue",
    "line2": "Tech Park",
    "city": "Bengaluru",
    "stateOrProvince": "Karnataka",
    "postalCode": "560001",
    "countryCode": "IN",
    "phone": "+91-9000000000"
  },
  "billingAddress": {
    "recipientName": "Aarav Sharma",
    "line1": "101 Developer Avenue",
    "line2": "Tech Park",
    "city": "Bengaluru",
    "stateOrProvince": "Karnataka",
    "postalCode": "560001",
    "countryCode": "IN",
    "phone": "+91-9000000000"
  }
}

### Get Order by ID
GET {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### Cancel Order
POST {{BullMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Accept: application/json
